---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (Shared across sale types)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_target: authorized
    q_check_target --> q_check_existing: target address != zero and != source
    q_check_target --> q_revert_target: invalid target
    q_revert_target --> [*]: revert InvalidTarget
    q_check_existing --> q_transfer_pos: target has no existing position
    q_check_existing --> q_revert_existing: target already has position
    q_revert_existing --> [*]: revert TargetHasPosition
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_source: copy position data from source to target
    q_clear_source --> [*]: clear source position, emit PositionTransferred

    note right of q_transfer_pos
        INV-001: only Legion operators can transfer positions
        INV-002: target must not have existing position (no merge)
        INV-003: source position fully cleared after transfer
        INV-004: vesting contract ownership also transferred if applicable
    end note
